 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "hook",
   "text": "Brand new full bathroom remodels, starting at just $14,995.",
   "t0": 0.0,
   "t1": 5.0
  },
  {
   "id": "b1",
   "text": "Most homeowners think a full bathroom remodel has to cost thirty thousand dollars.",
   "t0": 5.9,
   "t1": 9.74
  },
  {
   "id": "b2",
   "text": "It does not.",
   "t0": 10.34,
   "t1": 11.08
  },
  {
   "id": "b3",
   "text": "This is the whole bathroom, start to finish, taken down and built back new.",
   "t0": 11.28,
   "t1": 15.8
  },
  {
   "id": "b4",
   "text": "That is why it starts at $14,995, instead of the thirty thousand most companies will quote you for the exact same bathroom.",
   "t0": 16.08,
   "t1": 26.38
  },
  {
   "id": "b5",
   "text": "Here is what you get.",
   "t0": 26.6,
   "t1": 27.36
  },
  {
   "id": "b6",
   "text": "We take out the old bathroom and haul it away.",
   "t0": 27.62,
   "t1": 29.98
  },
  {
   "id": "b7",
   "text": "We put in a brand new shower or bathtub and waterproof it properly.",
   "t0": 30.3,
   "t1": 34.0
  },
  {
   "id": "b8",
   "text": "You get new wall surrounds, and you choose how they are finished, tile or acrylic, whichever you want.",
   "t0": 34.42,
   "t1": 39.84
  },
  {
   "id": "b9",
   "text": "You also get a brand new glass shower door, a new vanity, a new toilet, new flooring, and all new fixtures.",
   "t0": 40.04,
   "t1": 47.18
  },
  {
   "id": "b10",
   "text": "Labor and materials are both included.",
   "t0": 47.86,
   "t1": 49.64
  },
  {
   "id": "b11",
   "text": "The final price depends on the size of your bathroom and the materials you choose, and you get an honest number before we start.",
   "t0": 49.88,
   "t1": 56.36
  },
  {
   "id": "b12",
   "text": "At Luxury Home Renovations, we are a licensed bathroom remodeling contractor with 38 years of experience, licensed in both Tennessee and Georgia.",
   "t0": 56.72,
   "t1": 66.0
  },
  {
   "id": "b13",
   "text": "Our own crews do the work, not subcontractors, including the electrical and the plumbing.",
   "t0": 66.4,
   "t1": 71.82
  },
  {
   "id": "b14",
   "text": "And you pick your materials in person in our own showroom.",
   "t0": 72.24,
   "t1": 75.04
  },
  {
   "id": "b15",
   "text": "Your work is backed by a two year labor warranty, plus the full manufacturer warranties on your materials.",
   "t0": 75.34,
   "t1": 80.92
  },
  {
   "id": "cta",
   "text": "Click \"Get Quote\" to book your free design consultation.",
   "t0": 81.32,
   "t1": 84.5
  }
 ]
}